    "D\u0131\u015fa D\u00f6n\u00fck Kanallar": "I\u0161einan\u010dios kanalai", // EN: Outbound Channels
    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "\u012evykiai lieka program\u0117l\u0117je; jei norite, si\u0173skite t\u0105 pat\u012f prane\u0161im\u0105 \u012f savo telefono prane\u0161im\u0173 centr\u0105 arba \u012f Telegram\u0105. Nei vieno i\u0161 j\u0173 nereikia.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "\u012eveskite temos pavadinim\u0105 \u2014 nereikia paskyros", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "Tema", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Prane\u0161imai skelbiami \u0161ioje temoje ntfy.sh; jei tik j\u016bs \u017einote temos pavadinim\u0105, tik j\u016bs juos gaunate.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "El. pa\u0161tas", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "\u012esp\u0117jimai siun\u010diami \u012f j\u016bs\u0173 paskyros el. pa\u0161to adres\u0105", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "I\u0161si\u0173sta \u012f j\u016bs\u0173 pat\u012f adres\u0105, kai esate prisijung\u0119; program\u0117l\u0117je nesaugomi jokie slapti duomenys.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Gav\u0117jas", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Prane\u0161imai keliuose \u012frenginiuose", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "\u0160eimos nario \u012fsp\u0117jimas pasirodo prane\u0161im\u0173 centre net kai programa u\u017edaryta", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "Pasiekia kit\u0173 nari\u0173 ir j\u016bs\u0173 kit\u0173 \u012frengini\u0173 prane\u0161im\u0173 centrus; gav\u0117jas turi tur\u0117ti \u012fjungt\u0105 \u0161\u012f kanal\u0105 savo \u012frenginyje.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST \u012f j\u016bs\u0173 server\u012f \u2014 pa\u017eengusi", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "HTTPS URL", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "Priimamas tik HTTPS; kiekvienas \u012fvykis siun\u010diamas kaip {source, id, title, detail, ts}.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
    "Bot anahtar\u0131": "Bot tokenas", // EN: Bot token
    "Sohbet ID": "Chat ID", // EN: Chat ID
    "Bot anahtar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda kal\u0131r": "Bot tokenas lieka tik \u0161iame \u012frenginyje", // EN: The bot token stays on this device only
    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "Tokenas niekada n\u0117ra \u012fkeliamas \u012f debes\u012f; \u012fveskite j\u012f i\u0161 naujo kituose \u012frenginiuose.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
    "Sistem Bildirimleri": "Sistemos prane\u0161imai", // EN: System Notifications
    "Taray\u0131c\u0131 ve telefonun uyar\u0131 merkezi": "J\u016bs\u0173 nar\u0161ykl\u0117s ir telefono prane\u0161im\u0173 centras", // EN: Your browser and phone notification centre
