    "Aboneli\u011finiz yok \u2014 t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u015fu an \u00fccretsiz. NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda.": "J\u016bs neturite prenumeratos \u2014 \u0161iuo metu visos funkcijos yra nemokamos. NEXUS+ bus netrukus.", // EN: You don't have a subscription — every feature is free right now. NEXUS+ is coming soon.
