    "Adres biliyorsan tek tek yaz, bilmiyorsan modem a\u011f\u0131n\u0131n \u00f6n ekini b\u0131rak (192.168.1 gibi) \u2014 NEXUS 254 adresi birlikte yoklar.": "Jei \u017einote adres\u0105, \u012fveskite j\u012f; jei ne, palikite savo mar\u0161rutizatoriaus tinklo prefiks\u0105 (pvz., 192.168.1) \u2014 NEXUS tikrina visus 254 adresus.", // EN: If you know the address, type it; if not, leave your router network prefix (like 192.168.1) — NEXUS checks all 254 addresses.
