    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu. Okunmayan bir de\u011fer varsa \"Durum okunmad\u0131\" yazar.": "Paskutin\u0117 \u017einoma j\u016bs\u0173 \u012frengini\u0173 b\u016bsena. Vert\u0117, kuri nebuvo perskaityta, rodo \u201eB\u016bsena neperskaityta\u201c.", // EN: Last known state of your devices. A value that was not read shows "State not read".
    "A\u00c7IK G\u00d6R\u00dcNEN C\u0130HAZLAR": "\u012eRANGA, KURI RODOMA \u012eJUNGTA", // EN: DEVICES THAT APPEAR ON
