    "Durum okunmad\u0131": "B\u016bsena neperskaityta", // EN: State not read
    "Bu zaten \u015fu an kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n e-posta adresi. Farkl\u0131 bir adres gir.": "Tai jau yra j\u016bs\u0173 naudojamas el. pa\u0161to adresas. \u012eveskite kit\u0105.", // EN: This is already the email address you are using. Enter a different one.
    "Bu e-posta adresi ba\u015fka bir hesapta kay\u0131tl\u0131. Ba\u015fka bir adres dene.": "\u0160is el. pa\u0161to adresas u\u017eregistruotas kitai paskyrai. Bandykite kit\u0105.", // EN: This email address is registered to another account. Try a different one.
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denendi. Birka\u00e7 dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Per daug bandym\u0173. Pabandykite dar kart\u0105 po keli\u0173 minu\u010di\u0173.", // EN: Too many attempts. Try again in a few minutes.
    "\u00c7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131": "Neprisijung\u0119s", // EN: Offline
    "Hedef okunmad\u0131": "Tikslas neperskaitytas", // EN: Target not read
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm verisi yok": "N\u0117ra matavimo duomen\u0173", // EN: No measurement data
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar hen\u00fcz s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem veya hava kalitesi verisi vermedi. Sens\u00f6r\u00fcn a\u00e7\u0131k ve a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "J\u016bs\u0173 \u012frenginiai dar neprane\u0161\u0117 apie temperat\u016br\u0105, dr\u0117gm\u0119 ar oro kokyb\u0119. \u012esitikinkite, kad jutiklis \u012fjungtas ir prijungtas prie tinklo.", // EN: Your devices have not reported temperature, humidity or air quality yet. Make sure the sensor is on and on the network.
    "Son okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler": "Naujausi duomenys", // EN: Latest readings
    "Skor \u00fcretmiyoruz; yaln\u0131zca cihazlardan okunan ger\u00e7ek de\u011ferler g\u00f6sterilir.": "Mes nesudarome balo; rodome tik tikr\u0105sias reik\u0161mes, gautas i\u0161 j\u016bs\u0173 \u012frengini\u0173.", // EN: We do not produce a score; only real values read from your devices are shown.
    "Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bitirdi\u011finde \u015fu cihazlara uygulan\u0131r.": "Kai baigsite, tai bus taikoma \u0161iems \u012frenginiams.", // EN: When you finish, this is applied to the following devices.
    "Uyku haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun cihaz yok": "N\u0117ra tinkamo \u012frenginio miego paruo\u0161imui", // EN: No suitable device for sleep preparation
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, kilit veya iklim cihaz\u0131 ekledi\u011finde haz\u0131rl\u0131k burada listelenir.": "Kai prid\u0117site \u0161viesos, u\u017euolaid\u0173, spynos ar klimato \u012frengin\u012f, paruo\u0161imas bus rodomas \u010dia.", // EN: Once you add a light, curtain, lock or climate device, the preparation is listed here.
    "\u0130klim cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu ve okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler.": "Paskutin\u0117 \u017einoma j\u016bs\u0173 klimato \u012frengini\u0173 b\u016bsena ir duomenys.", // EN: Last known state and readings of your climate devices.
    "Kamera gizlili\u011fi": "Kameros privatumas", // EN: Camera privacy
    "Her kameran\u0131n gizlilik modunu ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Valdykite kiekvienos kameros privatumo re\u017eim\u0105 atskirai.", // EN: Manage each camera's privacy mode separately.
