    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 priz, anahtar ve enerji \u00fcr\u00fcnleri": "I\u0161manieji ki\u0161tukai, jungikliai ir energij\u0105 taupantys produktai", // EN: Smart plugs, switches and energy products
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "Greiti taupymo srautai i\u0161maniesiems ki\u0161tukams ir energij\u0105 taupantiems \u012frenginiams.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 tek merkezde topla. Hemen uygulanabilen tasarruf profilleri ve zamanl\u0131 eko aksiyonlar\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Sujunkite i\u0161maniuosius ki\u0161tukus ir energij\u0105 vartojan\u010dius \u012frenginius vienoje vietoje. Kurkite momentinius taupymo profilius ir suplanuotas ekologi\u0161kas veiklas.", // EN: Bring smart plugs and energy-consuming devices together in one place. Create instant saving profiles and scheduled eco actions.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Sukurkite energij\u0105 taupan\u010di\u0105 valdymo skydel\u012f, kuris tvarko i\u0161maniuosius ki\u0161tukus ir energij\u0105 vartojan\u010dius \u012frenginius. Prid\u0117kite greit\u0105 i\u0161jungim\u0105, ekoprofil\u012f, suplanuot\u0105 taupym\u0105 ir naudojimo santraukas.", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
