    "Ana ekran\u0131n sa\u011f \u00fcst\u00fcndeki + butonuna dokun, \"Tara\" ile QR kodu okut ya da kurulum kodunu elle gir.": "Paspauskite + mygtuk\u0105 vir\u0161utiniame de\u0161iniajame pagrindinio ekrano kampe, nuskaitykite QR kod\u0105 su \u201eNuskaityti\u201c arba \u012fveskite nustatymo kod\u0105 rankiniu b\u016bdu.", // EN: Tap the + button at the top right of the home screen, scan the QR code with "Scan" or enter the setup code manually.
    "Ana ekran\u0131n sa\u011f \u00fcst\u00fcndeki + butonuna dokunun ve \"Tara\" ile cihaz\u0131n QR kodunu okutun ya da kurulum kodunu elle girin.": "Paspauskite + mygtuk\u0105 vir\u0161utiniame de\u0161iniajame pagrindinio ekrano kampe ir nuskaitykite \u012frenginio QR kod\u0105 su \u201eNuskaityti\u201c arba \u012fveskite nustatymo kod\u0105 rankiniu b\u016bdu.", // EN: Tap the + button at the top right of the home screen and scan the device's QR code with "Scan", or enter the setup code manually.
    "Ana giri\u015f ve garaj kap\u0131s\u0131 g\u00fcvenli.": "Pagrindiniai \u012f\u0117jimo ir gara\u017eo dur\u0173 u\u017eraktai yra saug\u016bs.", // EN: Main entrance and garage door are secure.
