    "Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131nda bu kodu girerek NEXUS cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 HomeKit'e ekle.": "\u012eveskite \u0161\u012f kod\u0105 \u201eApple Home\u201c program\u0117l\u0117je, nor\u0117dami prid\u0117ti NEXUS \u012frenginius prie HomeKit.", // EN: Enter this code in the Apple Home app to add NEXUS devices to HomeKit.
