    "Bilgilerini girdikten sonra g\u00f6nderilecek ad\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek \u015fifreni kolayca yenileyebilirsin.": "\u012eved\u0119 savo duomenis, galite lengvai atstatyti slapta\u017eod\u012f, sekdami \u017eingsnius, kuriuos mes siun\u010diame.", // EN: After entering your details, you can easily reset your password by following the steps we send.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131nda NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan; ayn\u0131 asistan ve kontroller orada da \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Naudokite NEXUS darbalaukio program\u0105 kompiuteryje; ten veikia tas pats pad\u0117j\u0117jas ir valdikliai.", // EN: Use the NEXUS desktop app on your computer; the same assistant and controls work there too.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131ndan da sohbet et; konu\u015fmalar\u0131n t\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131nda senkronize kal\u0131r.": "Bendraukite i\u0161 savo kompiuterio; j\u016bs\u0173 pokalbiai lieka sinchronizuoti visuose \u012frenginiuose.", // EN: Chat from your computer too; your conversations stay in sync across your devices.
    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "Prisijungti prie nam\u0173", // EN: Join a Home
