    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Bakstel\u0117kite \u012frengin\u012f, kad atidarytum\u0117te valdymo skydelio ekran\u0105; jis rodo tik tas funkcijas, kurias palaiko tas \u012frenginys. Shelly, WLED ir ESPHome \u012frenginiams \u012fjungimas/i\u0161jungimas ir ry\u0161kumas siun\u010diami tiesiai \u012f \u012frengin\u012f.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "\u0160is kodas naudojamas ekrane Prisijungti prie nam\u0173.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
