    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "\u0160is 8 skaitmen\u0173 kodas skirtas Apple HomeKit poravimui ir veikia tik su Apple Home programa. Jei \u012frenginys palaiko vietin\u012f API, pvz., Shelly, WLED ar Tasmota, galite j\u012f prid\u0117ti i\u0161 savo vietinio tinklo.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "\u0160is \u012frenginys", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "\u0160is QR kodas priklauso \u201eWi-Fi\u201c tinklui, o ne \u012frenginiui. Prijung\u0119 \u012frengin\u012f prie to paties tinklo, galite j\u012f prid\u0117ti i\u0161 savo vietinio tinklo.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Nepavyko rasti jokio \u017einomo NEXUS \u012frenginio \u0161iuo adresu. \u012esitikinkite, kad \u012frenginys \u012fjungtas ir prijungtas prie to paties tinklo.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Sukurti \u0161i\u0105 i\u0161mani\u0105j\u0105 program\u0117l\u0119:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Ruo\u0161iamos si\u016blomos funkcijos \u0161iam srautui.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "I\u0161saugota \u0161\u012f m\u0117nes\u012f", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "Tinklas nerado jokio palaikomo \u012frenginio.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "Tinklas nerado jokio palaikomo \u012frenginio. \u012esitikinkite, kad \u012frenginys \u012fjungtas ir prijungtas prie to paties \u201eWi-Fi\u201c; kitu atveju naudokite \u017eemiau esant\u012f katalog\u0105 arba QR / diegimo kod\u0105.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Vietin\u0117 \u0161io \u012frenginio apsauga", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "\u0160is \u012frenginys nesidalija versijos informacija", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "\u0160is \u012frenginys arba ry\u0161ys nepalaiko \u017eibintuv\u0117lio.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "\u0160is \u012frenginys nepalaiko automatin\u0117s vietos nustatymo.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "\u0160is kvietimo kodas nerastas.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "\u0160is ekranas grupuoja prid\u0117tus ap\u0161vietimo \u012frenginius pagal kambarius; kai i\u0161saugote scen\u0105, ry\u0161kumas ir tonas nustatomi kartu.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "\u010cia i\u0161vardyti \u012f \u0161\u012f nam\u0105 prid\u0117ti \u012frenginiai.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "\u010cia i\u0161vardyti \u012f \u0161\u012f nam\u0105 prid\u0117ti \u012frenginiai ir susieti su j\u016bs\u0173 m\u0117gstamiausiomis kortel\u0117mis.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Ar tikrai norite visam laikui i\u0161trinti \u0161\u012f nam\u0105 ir visus jo nustatymus?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "\u0160is kodas n\u0117ra palaikomas \u012frenginio kodas. Jei \u017einote \u012frenginio IP adres\u0105, galite j\u012f prid\u0117ti i\u0161 vietinio tinklo.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "\u0160iais prek\u0117s \u017eenklais galima valdyti per vietin\u012f tinkl\u0105.", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "\u0160i mini programa teikiama oficialaus tiek\u0117jo.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "\u0160i aplinka nepalaiko kameros prieigos.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Tinklo nuskaitymas \u010dia n\u0117ra prieinamas.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "\u0160ioje aplinkoje n\u0117ra saugaus \u0161ifravimo.", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "Kai \u0161i scenarija vyksta, susij\u0119 \u012frenginiai automati\u0161kai reguliuojami.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "\u0160iuo scenarijumi niekas \u012frenginys nebus paveiktas \u2014 pirmiausia prid\u0117kite tinkam\u0105 \u012frengin\u012f.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Jums reikia prid\u0117ti suderinam\u0105 \u012frengin\u012f, kad gal\u0117tum\u0117te naudoti \u0161\u012f scenarij\u0173.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
    "Bu tek evin. Silersen bo\u015f bir \"Evim\" yeniden olu\u015fturulur. Devam edilsin mi?": "Tai yra j\u016bs\u0173 vieninteliai namai. Jei juos i\u0161trinsite, v\u0117l bus sukurti tu\u0161ti \u201eMano namai\u201c. T\u0119sti?", // EN: This is your only home. If you delete it, an empty "My Home" will be created again. Continue?
