    "Bunu tam \u00e7\u00f6zemedim. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki formdan ekibimize geri bildirim g\u00f6nderirsen en k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f yapal\u0131m; ya da \"Tam sohbeti a\u00e7\" ile devam edebilirsin.": "Negal\u0117jau to pilnai i\u0161spr\u0119sti. Si\u0173skite m\u016bs\u0173 komandai atsiliepimus naudodami \u017eemiau pateikt\u0105 form\u0105, ir mes su jumis susisieksime kuo grei\u010diau, arba t\u0119skite su \u201eAtidaryti vis\u0105 pokalb\u012f\u201c.", // EN: I couldn't fully solve that. Send our team feedback with the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as we can, or continue with "Open full chat".
