    "Cihaz eklenince kontrol g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Valdikliai pasirodys, kai \u012frenginys bus prid\u0117tas.", // EN: Controls appear once a device is added.
    "Cihaz g\u00fcncellemeleri": "\u012erenginio naujiniai", // EN: Device updates
