    "Cihazlar\u0131na dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edin, stratejilerle otomatik tasarruf et.": "Gaukite \u012f\u017evalg\u0173 apie savo \u012frenginius ir automati\u0161kai taupykite su strategijomis.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and save automatically with strategies.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik tarama, QR kod, kurulum kodu ya da manuel katalog ile ekleyebilirsin.": "Galite prid\u0117ti savo \u012frenginius naudojant automatin\u012f nuskaitym\u0105, QR kod\u0105, nustatymo kod\u0105 arba rankin\u012f katalog\u0105.", // EN: You can add your devices with automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131za dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edinin ve enerji ipu\u00e7lar\u0131 al\u0131n.": "Gaukite \u012f\u017evalg\u0173 apie savo \u012frenginius ir energijos patarimus.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and energy tips.
    "Cihaz\u0131 Do\u011frula": "Patvirtinti \u012frengin\u012f", // EN: Verify Device
    "Cihaz\u0131 Se\u00e7": "Pasirinkti \u012frengin\u012f", // EN: Select Device
    "Cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r": "Pa\u0161alinti \u012frengin\u012f", // EN: Remove device
    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Kod\u0117l mano \u012frenginys rodomas neprisijung\u0119s?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "\u012eveskite \u012frenginio IP adres\u0105 ir NEXUS nustatys, kokiu protokolu jis naudojasi.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Patikrinkite \u012frenginio Wi-Fi ry\u0161\u012f ir savo mar\u0161rutizatori\u0173. Jei problema t\u0119siasi, pa\u0161alinkite \u012frengin\u012f ir prid\u0117kite j\u012f dar kart\u0105. Veiksmai: \u012erenginiai > pasirinkite \u012frengin\u012f > Pa\u0161alinti.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Patikrinkite \u012frenginio Wi-Fi ry\u0161\u012f ir savo mar\u0161rutizatori\u0173. Jei problema t\u0119siasi, pa\u0161alinkite \u012frengin\u012f i\u0161 NEXUS programos ir prid\u0117kite j\u012f v\u0117l.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Jei j\u016bs\u0173 \u012frenginys neatsiranda, naudokite QR nuskaitym\u0105 arba nustatymo kod\u0105. Galite atidaryti pagalbos puslap\u012f nor\u0117dami gauti param\u0105 ir instrukcijas.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "J\u016bs\u0173 \u012frenginio vietos (GPS) paslauga i\u0161jungta. \u012ejunkite j\u0105 ir pabandykite dar kart\u0105.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "J\u016bs\u0173 \u012frenginys nepalaiko vietos paslaug\u0173.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
    "Cihaz\u0131n listede yok mu? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "\u012erenginio n\u0117ra s\u0105ra\u0161e? Si\u0173skite atsiliepim\u0105", // EN: Device not on the list? Send feedback
    "Cihaz\u0131n yerel anahtar\u0131 gerekir \u2014 yak\u0131nda": "Reikalingas \u012frenginio vietinis raktas \u2014 netrukus", // EN: Needs the device's local key — coming soon
