    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "I\u0161jungti visus ap\u0161vietimo grupes, paliktus \u012fjungtus namuose.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "B\u016bnant namuose ir i\u0161vykus", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "I\u0161vykus", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Kai i\u0161vykstate", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Valdykite ap\u0161vietim\u0105 j\u016bs\u0173 namuose kambarys po kambario vienu srautu. \u012ejungimas/i\u0161jungimas, ry\u0161kumas, spalvos temperat\u016bra ir greiti scen\u0173 spartieji klavi\u0161ai vienoje program\u0117l\u0117je.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Pateikite paruo\u0161tas komandas, greitas automatizacijas ir i\u0161manias program\u0117li\u0173 rekomendacijas, remiantis namuose esan\u010diais \u012frenginiais.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Sukurkite klimato komforto program\u0117l\u0119, kuri valdyt\u0173 j\u016bs\u0173 nam\u0173 oro kondicionierius ir termostatus i\u0161 vienos panel\u0117s. \u012etraukite temperat\u016bros valdym\u0105, greituosius re\u017eimus, taupymo re\u017eim\u0105 ir veiksmus pagal patalpas.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Koks yra mano \u012frengini\u0173 statusas?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
    "Evden Uzakta": "N\u0117ra namuose", // EN: Away from Home
    "Evden Uzakta Senaryosu": "Scena \u201eN\u0117ra namuose\u201c", // EN: Away from Home Scene
    "Evden ayr\u0131l\u0131rken enerji ve g\u00fcvenlik kontrollerini toparlar.": "Atlieka energijos ir saugumo patikrinimus, kai i\u0161einate i\u0161 nam\u0173.", // EN: Wraps up energy and security checks when you leave home.
    "Evden uzakta": "N\u0117ra namuose", // EN: Away from home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "I\u0161einant i\u0161 nam\u0173", // EN: Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Kontrol\u00fc": "Patikra i\u0161einant i\u0161 nam\u0173", // EN: Leaving Home Check
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Senaryosu": "Scena \u201eI\u0161einant i\u0161 nam\u0173\u201c", // EN: Leaving Home Scene
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f \u00d6zeti": "Santrauka i\u0161einant i\u0161 nam\u0173", // EN: Leaving Home Summary
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "U\u017ebaigti i\u0161einant i\u0161 nam\u0173", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Sukurkite program\u0117l\u0119 patikrinimui i\u0161einant i\u0161 nam\u0173, kuri viename ekrane rodyt\u0173 paliktus \u012fjungtus \u012frenginius, u\u017erakinimo status\u0105 ir energijos nustatymus. Prid\u0117kite greito i\u0161jungimo ir saugumo \u012fjungimo mygtukus.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Patikrinkite paliktus \u012fjungtus \u012frenginius, u\u017erakt\u0173 ir energijos status\u0105 viena eiga, i\u0161einant i\u0161 nam\u0173.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Rodykite prietaisus, paliktus \u012fjungtus, u\u017eraktus ir energijos b\u016bsen\u0105 viename ekrane, i\u0161einant i\u0161 nam\u0173.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Per\u017ei\u016br\u0117kite \u0161viesas, ki\u0161tukus, kondicionierius ir saugumo nustatymus, paliktus \u012fjungtus prie\u0161 i\u0161einant i\u0161 nam\u0173, viename skydelyje. Surinkite greitus i\u0161jungimo ir saugumo aktyvavimo veiksmus \u012f vien\u0105 sraut\u0105.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Atlikime galutinius patikrinimus prie\u0161 i\u0161einant.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "Automati\u0161kai i\u0161junkite \u0161viesas po i\u0161\u0117jimo...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "Automati\u0161kai i\u0161junkite \u0161viesas po i\u0161\u0117jimo i\u0161 nam\u0173", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Automati\u0161kai i\u0161junkite \u0161viesas po j\u016bs\u0173 i\u0161\u0117jimo ir \u012fjunkite jas, kai gr\u012f\u0161ite.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Automati\u0161kai i\u0161junkite oro kondicionieri\u0173, kai namuose niekas n\u0117ra, ir venkite bereikalingo vartojimo.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Automati\u0161kai nutraukite elektros tiekim\u0105 bud\u0117jimo re\u017eimu esan\u010diuose prietaisuose nakt\u012f, pasirinktu laiku.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "I\u0161einant i\u0161 nam\u0173", // EN: When leaving home
