    "Eve vard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya evden ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kai atvykstate namo arba i\u0161einate", // EN: When you arrive home or leave
    "Eve yakla\u015f\u0131rken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 a\u00e7, klimay\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve garaj kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 arac\u0131n\u0131n ekran\u0131ndan kontrol et.": "\u012ejunkite \u0161viesas, \u012fjunkite oro kondicionieri\u0173 ir valdykite gara\u017eo duris i\u0161 savo automobilio ekrano art\u0117jant prie nam\u0173.", // EN: Turn on the lights, start the AC and control the garage door from your car's screen as you approach home.
    "Evet, Uygula": "Taip, Taikyti", // EN: Yes, Apply
    "Evet, \u0130ptal Et": "Taip, At\u0161aukti", // EN: Yes, Cancel
    "Evet. NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "Taip. NEXUS pirmiausia veikia vietoje; j\u016bs\u0173 \u012frenginio duomenys lieka \u0161iame \u012frenginyje ir n\u0117ra dalijami su tre\u010diosiomis \u0161alimis.", // EN: Yes. NEXUS is local-first; your device data stays on this device and isn't shared with third parties.
