    "uyar\u0131 payla\u015ft\u0131": "pasidalinta \u012fsp\u0117jimu", // EN: shared an alert
    "Bu hafta kayda de\u011fer bir etkinlik yok. Senaryo \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmalar\u0131 ve uyar\u0131lar burada toplan\u0131r.": "\u0160i\u0105 savait\u0119 reik\u0161mingos veiklos nebuvo. \u010cia susirinksta scen\u0173 vykdymai ir \u012fsp\u0117jimai.", // EN: No notable activity this week. Scene runs and alerts gather here.
    "Al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f listesi, ev i\u015fleri ya da k\u0131sa notlar \u2014 ailenle payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n ilk maddeyi ekle.": "Pirkini\u0173 s\u0105ra\u0161as, buities darbai ar greitos pastabos \u2014 prid\u0117kite pirm\u0105 element\u0105, kad pasidalytum\u0117te su \u0161eima.", // EN: Shopping list, chores or quick notes — add the first item to share with your family.
    "Ev Panosu evin \u00fcyeleri aras\u0131ndad\u0131r. Ev Y\u00f6netimi'nden ev olu\u015ftur ya da davetle kat\u0131l.": "Valdyba priklauso j\u016bs\u0173 nam\u0173 nariams. Sukurkite namus per Nam\u0173 valdym\u0105 arba prisijunkite pagal kvietim\u0105.", // EN: The board belongs to your home's members. Create a home from Home Management or join by invite.
    "Bu madde panodan t\u00fcm \u00fcyeler i\u00e7in kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.": "\u0160is elementas pa\u0161alinamas i\u0161 valdybos visiems nariams.", // EN: This item is removed from the board for all members.
    "Pano \u015fu an kapal\u0131.": "Valdyba \u0161iuo metu nepasiekiama.", // EN: The board is unavailable right now.
    "Ev Panosu i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7mal\u0131s\u0131n.": "Prisijunkite, kad gal\u0117tum\u0117te naudoti Nam\u0173 Valdyb\u0105.", // EN: Sign in to use the Home Board.
    "Ev Panosu bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Nam\u0173 Valdyba nepasiekiama \u0161ioje versijoje.", // EN: Home Board is unavailable in this build.
