    "Listeye ekle ya da not yaz\u2026": "\u012etraukti \u012f s\u0105ra\u0161\u0105 arba para\u0161yti pastab\u0105\u2026", // EN: Add to the list or write a note…
    "T\u00fcr de\u011fi\u015ftir: liste maddesi / not": "Perjungti tip\u0105: s\u0105ra\u0161o elementas / pastaba", // EN: Switch type: list item / note
