    "Evindeki t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et": "Valdykite visus ap\u0161vietimo \u012frenginius savo namuose", // EN: Control all lighting devices in your home
    "Evine bir isim ver.": "Pavadinkite savo namus.", // EN: Give your home a name.
    "Evinin ad\u0131n\u0131 d\u00fczenle.": "Redaguoti nam\u0173 pavadinim\u0105.", // EN: Edit your home's name.
    "Eviniz \u015fu anda sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 ya\u015fam standartlar\u0131n\u0131n %82 \u00fczerinde.": "J\u016bs\u0173 namai \u0161iuo metu yra 82% vir\u0161 sveikos gyvenimo standart\u0173.", // EN: Your home is currently 82% above healthy living standards.
    "Evinizin kontrol\u00fcn\u00fc otomatikle\u015ftirmek i\u00e7in bir senaryo ba\u015flat\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 se\u00e7in.": "Pasirinkite scenarijaus triger\u012f, kad automatizuotum\u0117te nam\u0173 valdym\u0105.", // EN: Choose a scenario trigger to automate control of your home.
