    "E\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131na kapatma komutu g\u00f6nderildi. Enerji tasarrufu modu devrede.": "J\u016bs\u0173 suporuotiems \u012frenginiams i\u0161si\u0173sta i\u0161jungimo komanda. Energijos taupymo re\u017eimas \u012fjungtas.", // EN: A turn-off command was sent to your paired devices. Energy saving mode is on.
