    "Harika bir fikir! \u0130stedi\u011fin detaylara g\u00f6re uygulanabilir bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulad\u0131m ve ilgili listeye ekledim. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan hemen g\u00f6z atabilirsin! [ACTION: CREATE_SCENARIO]": "Puiki id\u0117ja! I\u0161 j\u016bs\u0173 pateikt\u0173 detali\u0173 suk\u016briau vykdom\u0105 i\u0161man\u0173j\u012f scenarij\u0173 ir prid\u0117jau j\u012f prie s\u0105ra\u0161o. Pa\u017evelkite \u017eemiau! [VEIKSMAS: SUKURTI_SCENARIJ\u0172]", // EN: Great idea! I've built a runnable smart scenario from your details and added it to the list. Take a look below! [ACTION: CREATE_SCENARIO]
