    "Kamera, kilit ve sens\u00f6rleri tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir ev g\u00fcvenlik merkezi olu\u015ftur. Evdeyim ve d\u0131\u015far\u0131day\u0131m modlar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 kontrol butonlar\u0131 ve kritik durum \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Sukurkite nam\u0173 saugumo centr\u0105, kuris viename ekrane rodyt\u0173 kameras, spynas ir jutiklius. Prid\u0117kite nam\u0173 ir i\u0161vykimo re\u017eimus, greito valdymo mygtukus ir kritini\u0173 b\u016bsen\u0173 santraukas.", // EN: Create a home security center that shows cameras, locks and sensors on one screen. Add at-home and away modes, quick control buttons and critical status summaries.
