    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc, iOS cihaz\u0131nla ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da olmal\u0131. Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131k kald\u0131k\u00e7a e\u015fle\u015fme ge\u00e7erli kal\u0131r (tepsi/arka plan \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 destekler).": "Tiltas turi b\u016bti prijungtas prie to paties Wi-Fi tinklo kaip j\u016bs\u0173 iOS \u012frenginys. Poravimas lieka galiojantis tol, kol j\u016bs\u0173 kompiuteris yra aktyvus (palaikoma veikla fonin\u0117je / d\u0117klo b\u016bsenoje).", // EN: The bridge has to be on the same Wi-Fi as your iOS device. The pairing stays valid as long as your computer stays awake (tray/background operation supported).
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc Ba\u015flat": "Paleisti tilt\u0105", // EN: Start the bridge
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcdeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, sonra tekrar dene.": "Paspauskite apval\u0173 mygtuk\u0105 ant tilto, tada bandykite dar kart\u0105.", // EN: Press the round button on the bridge, then try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcn\u00fcn \u00fcst\u00fcndeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, ard\u0131ndan 30 saniye i\u00e7inde \u201cK\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc ba\u011fla\u201dya dokun.": "Paspauskite apval\u0173 mygtuk\u0105 ant tilto vir\u0161aus, tada per 30 sekund\u017ei\u0173 palieskite \u201ePrisijungti prie tilto\u201c.", // EN: Press the round button on top of the bridge, then tap “Connect bridge” within 30 seconds.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "Nepavyko prisijungti prie tilto. \u012esitikinkite, kad esate tame pa\u010diame tinkle, ir bandykite dar kart\u0105.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011fl\u0131 lamba bulunamad\u0131.": "Nepavyko rasti prie tilto prijungt\u0173 lemp\u0173.", // EN: No lamps connected to the bridge were found.
