    "Matter cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 eklemek i\u00e7in bir Matter denetleyicisi gerekir; NEXUS bu deste\u011fi hen\u00fcz sunmuyor. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011flan\u0131yorsa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle ekleyebilirsin.": "Matter \u012frengini\u0173 prid\u0117jimui reikia Matter valdiklio, kurio NEXUS dar nepasi\u016blo. Jei \u012frenginys jungiasi per Wi-Fi, galite prid\u0117ti j\u012f i\u0161 savo vietinio tinklo pagal IP adres\u0105.", // EN: Adding Matter devices needs a Matter controller, which NEXUS doesn't offer yet. If the device connects over Wi-Fi, you can add it from your local network by its IP address.
