    "Misafir a\u011f\u0131 ayarlan\u0131nca burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "\u010cia pasirodys, kai bus nustatytas sve\u010di\u0173 tinklas.", // EN: It will appear here once the guest network is set up.
    "Misafir a\u011f\u0131 veya ge\u00e7ici eri\u015fim bilgisi olmadan haz\u0131r durum g\u00f6stermiyoruz.": "Mes nerodome paruo\u0161tos b\u016bsenos be sve\u010di\u0173 tinklo ar laikino prieigos duomen\u0173.", // EN: We don't show a ready state without guest network or temporary access details.
    "Misafir geldi\u011fi anda giri\u015f, ayd\u0131nlatma ve ortak alan cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 haz\u0131rlayan bir misafir modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Kar\u015f\u0131lama \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131, sessiz bildirim ve misafir eri\u015fim ad\u0131mlar\u0131 olsun.": "Sukurkite sve\u010dio re\u017eimo program\u0117l\u0119, kuri pasiruo\u0161ia \u012f\u0117jim\u0105, ap\u0161vietim\u0105 ir bendras erdves skirtus \u012frenginius vos atvykus sve\u010diams. \u012etraukite pasveikinimo \u0161vies\u0105, tyl\u0173 prane\u0161im\u0173 re\u017eim\u0105 ir sve\u010dio prieigos veiksmus.", // EN: Create a guest mode app that prepares the entrance, lighting and shared-area devices as soon as guests arrive. Include a welcome light, quiet notifications and guest access steps.
    "Misafir geldi\u011fi anda kullan\u0131lacak \u0131\u015f\u0131k, eri\u015fim ve ortam ayarlar\u0131.": "\u0160viesos, prieigos ir aplinkos nustatymai, kuriuos galima naudoti vos atvykus sve\u010diams.", // EN: Light, access and ambience settings to use as soon as guests arrive.
    "Misafir gelmeden \u00f6nce giri\u015f, ayd\u0131nlatma, ortak alan ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde haz\u0131rla. Ev i\u00e7inde rahat ama g\u00fcvenli bir kar\u015f\u0131lama ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Paruo\u0161kite \u012f\u0117jim\u0105, ap\u0161vietim\u0105, bendras zonas ir pramog\u0173 \u012frenginius vienoje panel\u0117je prie\u0161 atvykstant sve\u010diams. Sukurkite atsipalaidavusi\u0105, bet saugi\u0105 nam\u0173 sveikinimo eig\u0105.", // EN: Prepare the entrance, lighting, shared areas and entertainment devices on one panel before guests arrive. Create a relaxed but secure welcome flow at home.
