    "NEXUS AI puanlar\u0131n her g\u00fcn yenilenir; \u015fu an t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u00fccretsiz.": "J\u016bs\u0173 NEXUS AI ta\u0161kai atnaujinami kasdien; kiekviena funkcija \u0161iuo metu yra nemokama.", // EN: Your NEXUS AI points renew every day; every feature is free right now.
