    "NEXUS i\u00e7inde \"Bir Eve Kat\u0131l\" alan\u0131na bu kodu girerek kat\u0131labilirsin.": "Galite prisijungti \u012fved\u0119 \u0161\u012f kod\u0105 \"Join a Home\" NEXUS viduje.", // EN: You can join by entering this code in "Join a Home" inside NEXUS.
    "NEXUS senaryolar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Siri komutlar\u0131yla saniyeler i\u00e7inde sesle \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.": "Paleiskite savo NEXUS scenarijus balsu su Siri per kelias sekundes.", // EN: Run your NEXUS scenarios by voice with Siri in seconds.
    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "NEXUS yra pirmiausia vietinis: j\u016bs\u0173 \u012frenginio duomenys lieka \u0161iame \u012frenginyje, \u012frenginio komandos siun\u010diamos tiesiai per vietin\u012f tinkl\u0105, ir niekas n\u0117ra dalijama su tre\u010diosiomis \u0161alimis.", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
