    "NEXUS+ hen\u00fcz sat\u0131\u015fta de\u011fil. Cihaz ekleme, kontrol panelleri, senaryolar ve NEXUS AI \u015fu an tamamen \u00fccretsiz; abonelik a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda buradan haber verece\u011fiz.": "NEXUS+ dar n\u0117ra parduodamas. Prid\u0117ti \u012frenginius, scenarijus ir NEXUS AI \u0161iuo metu visi\u0161kai nemokama; apie prenumeratos atidarym\u0105 prane\u0161ime \u010dia.", // EN: NEXUS+ isn't on sale yet. Adding devices, scenarios and NEXUS AI are completely free right now; we'll let you know here when subscriptions open.
