    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "\u0160iame adrese yra \u012frenginys, bet jis nesinaudoja NEXUS protokolu.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "\u0160is \u012frenginys jau prid\u0117tas.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Suporuoti ir prid\u0117ti", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Suderinimo kodas yra neteisingas. \u012eveskite 11 skaitmen\u0173 kod\u0105 arba QR turin\u012f, prasidedant\u012f nuo MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "\u012eveskite \u0161\u012f kod\u0105 NEXUS darbalaukio program\u0117l\u0117je. Jei \u012frenginys yra prijungtas prie Wi-Fi, j\u012f taip pat galite prid\u0117ti per vietin\u012f tinkl\u0105 pagal jo IP adres\u0105.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "\u012erenginys ie\u0161komas tame pa\u010diame tinkle ir sukuriamas poravimas. Tai gali u\u017etrukti iki minut\u0117s; \u012frenginys turi b\u016bti \u012fjungtas ir poravimo re\u017eime.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "\u012erenginys nerastas arba negal\u0117jo b\u016bti suporuotas. \u012esitikinkite, kad jis yra toje pa\u010dioje tinkle, \u012fjungtas ir poravimo re\u017eime.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "\u012erenginys nerastas. \u012esitikinkite, kad jis yra toje pa\u010dioje tinkle, \u012fjungtas ir poravimo re\u017eime. J\u016bs\u0173 kompiuterio u\u017ekarda gali blokuoti atsakymus i\u0161 \u012frengini\u0173 vietiniame tinkle.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "\u012erenginys negal\u0117jo b\u016bti suporuotas. Patikrinkite poravimo kod\u0105 ir ar \u012frenginys yra poravimo re\u017eime.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "\u012erenginys buvo suporuotas, ta\u010diau NEXUS negali jo valdyti.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "\u012erenginys neatsak\u0117. \u012esitikinkite, kad jis \u012fjungtas ir prisijung\u0119s prie to paties tinklo.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
