    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "Vieno palietimo pramog\u0173 skydelis televizoriams ir multimedijos \u012frenginiams.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
    "TV, hoparl\u00f6r ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131": "Televizoriai, garsiakalbiai ir pramog\u0173 \u012frenginiai", // EN: TVs, speakers and entertainment devices
    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "Sujunkite televizori\u0173, medijos d\u0117\u017eut\u0119 ir aplinkos ap\u0161vietim\u0105 vienu veiksmu. Padarykite lengv\u0105 nustatyti filmo prad\u017ei\u0105, nakties re\u017eim\u0105 ir bla\u0161kymosi nevykdan\u010dias pramog\u0173 scenas.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "\u017dinoma! Galiu sukurti puik\u0173 i\u0161man\u0173 scenarij\u0173 jums. Ar gal\u0117tum\u0117te pateikti kelet\u0105 detali\u0173? Pavyzd\u017eiui: \"\u012ejunkite kavos aparat\u0105, kai atsikeliu\" arba \"Pilnai pritemdykite \u0161viesas, kai \u017ei\u016briu film\u0105\".", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
