    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Raskite vis\u0105 nam\u0173 tikrinim\u0105 prie\u0161 mieg\u0105 viename centre. Sumenkinkite \u0161viesas, nestokite ramyb\u0117s, patikrinkite u\u017erakt\u0105 ir nakties klimato nustatymus viename ekrane.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "Sukurkite miego pasiruo\u0161imo centr\u0105, kuris valdo \u0161viesas, tyl\u0173 re\u017eim\u0105, spynas ir klimato s\u0105lygas prie\u0161 mieg\u0105. Prid\u0117kite galutin\u0117s patikros santrauk\u0105 ir vieno bakstel\u0117jimo nakties re\u017eim\u0105.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
