    "Bu ekran\u0131 iPhone'daki NEXUS uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7; senaryolar\u0131n a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da listelenir ve her biri i\u00e7in Siri kestirmesi kurabilirsin.": "Atidarykite \u0161\u012f ekran\u0105 NEXUS program\u0117l\u0117je savo iPhone; j\u016bs\u0173 scenos i\u0161vardytos \u017eemiau ir galite nustatyti Siri nuorod\u0105 kiekvienai.", // EN: Open this screen in the NEXUS app on your iPhone; your scenes are listed below and you can set up a Siri shortcut for each one.
    "1. Senaryo ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kopyala": "1. Nukopijuokite scenos nuorod\u0105", // EN: 1. Copy the scene link
