    "\"Eylem Ekle\" \u203a \"URL'leri A\u00e7\" eylemini se\u00e7 ve kopyalad\u0131\u011f\u0131n ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.": "Pasirinkite \u201ePrid\u0117ti veiksm\u0105\u201c \u203a \u201eAtidaryti URL\u201c ir \u012fklijuokite nukopijuot\u0105 nuorod\u0105.", // EN: Choose "Add Action" › "Open URLs" and paste the link you copied.
