    "Cihazlar\u0131na uyan haz\u0131r otomasyonlardan birini tek dokunu\u015fla ekle.": "Prid\u0117kite paruo\u0161t\u0105 automatik\u0105, kuri tinka j\u016bs\u0173 \u012frenginiams vos vienu palietimu.", // EN: Add a ready-made automation that fits your devices with one tap.
