    "Duman, su bask\u0131n\u0131 ya da gaz sens\u00f6r\u00fc uyard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kai d\u016bm\u0173, potvyni\u0173 ar duj\u0173 jutiklis sukelia aliarm\u0105", // EN: When a smoke, flood or gas sensor raises an alarm
