    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Kiekvien\u0105 vakar\u0105 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "\u012ejungia oro kondicionieri\u0173 20\u00b0 temperat\u016broje ir nustato termostat\u0105 20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Nustato termostat\u0105 24\u00b0 komforto re\u017eimu.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Darbo dienomis 06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 a\u00e7ar.": "Atidaro visus u\u017euolaidas ir \u017ealiuzes.", // EN: Opens every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn do\u011fumunda": "Kiekvien\u0105 dien\u0105 saul\u0117tekio metu", // EN: Every day at sunrise
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "U\u017edaro visas u\u017euolaidas ir \u017ealiuzes.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Kiekvien\u0105 dien\u0105 saul\u0117lyd\u017eio metu", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "U\u017erakina visas i\u0161manias spynas (spynos niekada neatidaromos).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "I\u0161jungia \u0161viesas ir televizori\u0173; palieka ki\u0161tukus ir oro kondicionieri\u0173.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "\u012ejunkite arba i\u0161junkite \u012frengin\u012f", // EN: Turn a device on or off
