    "Kapans\u0131n": "I\u0161jungti", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Pasirinkite \u012frengin\u012f, kur\u012f norite valdyti.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Per\u017ei\u016br\u0117kite oro kokyb\u0119, temperat\u016br\u0105 ir dr\u0117gm\u0119, kuri\u0105 matuoja j\u016bs\u0173 jutikliai, ir valdykite oro valytuv\u0105.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Paruo\u0161kite \u0161viesas, u\u017euolaidas ir oro kondicionieri\u0173 dienai vienu bakstel\u0117jimu.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "\u012ejunkite \u0161viesas, u\u017euolaidas ir klimat\u0105 kartu, kai gr\u012f\u017etate namo.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Pad\u0117kite savo \u012frenginius \u012f saug\u0173, energij\u0105 taupant\u012f re\u017eim\u0105, kai b\u016bnate i\u0161vyk\u0119 ilgesniam laikui.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Prigesinkite \u0161viesas, u\u017edarykite u\u017euolaidas ir \u012fjunkite televizori\u0173.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Paleiskite savo robot\u0105 siurbl\u012f arba si\u0173skite j\u012f atgal \u012f dok\u0105.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "U\u017erakinkite duris, u\u017edarykite u\u017euolaidas ir paruo\u0161kite namus naktiai.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Viename ekrane matykite savo kamer\u0173 b\u016bsen\u0105 ir privatumo nustatymus.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "\u012ejunkite arba i\u0161junkite savo kamer\u0173 privatumo re\u017eim\u0105 vienoje vietoje b\u016bdami namuose.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Per\u017ei\u016br\u0117kite, kuri automatikos programa \u0161iandien veiks.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
