    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Per\u017ei\u016br\u0117kite savo nam\u0173 sveikatos santrauk\u0105 pagal oro, dr\u0117gm\u0117s ir temperat\u016bros rodmenis, kuriuos fiksuoja j\u016bs\u0173 jutikliai.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
