    "\u0130ptal bu hesapta yap\u0131l\u0131r. Mevcut d\u00f6nemin sonuna kadar NEXUS+ kullanmaya devam edersin; bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "At\u0161aukimas atliktas \u0161iame paskyroje. NEXUS+ i\u0161lieka iki einamosios laikotarpio pabaigos; kitas mok\u0117jimas nebus nuskai\u010diuotas.", // EN: Cancellation is done on this account. You keep NEXUS+ until the end of the current period; the next payment is not taken.
