    "\u00d6demeler": "Mok\u0117jimai", // EN: Payments
    "\u00d6demeyi tamamlay\u0131nca bu sayfada kal; aboneli\u011fin hesab\u0131na yaz\u0131l\u0131r.": "Laukite \u0161ioje puslapio puslapyje po mok\u0117jimo; prenumerata bus priskirta j\u016bs\u0173 paskyrai.", // EN: Stay on this page after you pay; the subscription is written to your account.
