    "yukar\u0131daki hesap e-postas\u0131n\u0131": "vir\u0161uje esantis paskyros el. pa\u0161tas", // EN: the account email above
    "\u0130ptal ve \u00f6deme y\u00f6ntemi de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011fi g\u00fcvenli \u00f6deme sayfam\u0131z Whop \u00fczerinden yap\u0131l\u0131r. \u0130ptal edersen mevcut d\u00f6nemin sonuna kadar kullanmaya devam edersin ve bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "Mok\u0117jimo metodo at\u0161aukimas ir keitimas vyksta m\u016bs\u0173 saugioje atsiskaitymo Whop puslapyje. Jei at\u0161auksite, galite naudotis NEXUS+ iki einamosios periodo pabaigos, o kitas mok\u0117jimas nebus paimtas.", // EN: Cancelling and changing your payment method happen on our secure checkout page, Whop. If you cancel, you keep using NEXUS+ until the end of the current period and the next payment is never taken.
    "Aboneli\u011fin yok. NEXUS+ i\u00e7in Plus sayfas\u0131ndan \u00fccretsiz deneyebilirsin.": "J\u016bs neturite prenumeratos. I\u0161bandykite NEXUS+ nemokamai i\u0161 Plus puslapio.", // EN: You don't have a subscription. Try NEXUS+ free from the Plus page.
    "QR, kurulum kodu veya manuel katalog ile ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "\u012erenginiai, kuriuos prid\u0117jote naudodami QR, diegimo kod\u0105 arba rankin\u012f katalog\u0105, rodomi \u010dia.", // EN: Devices you add by QR, setup code or the manual catalog show up here.
