    "Alarm kontrol paneli \u00b7 kur, kapat, sirene": "Signalizacijos valdymo skydelis \u00b7 \u012fjungti, i\u0161jungti, sirena", // EN: Alarm control panel · arm, disarm, siren
    "Perde ve panjur kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, konum": "U\u017euolaid\u0173 ir \u017ealiuzi\u0173 valdymo skydelis \u00b7 atidaryti, u\u017edaryti, pad\u0117tis", // EN: Curtain and blind control panel · open, close, position
