    "Hava kalitesi paneli \u00b7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm ve uyar\u0131lar": "Oro kokyb\u0117s skydelis \u00b7 rodmenys ir \u012fsp\u0117jimai", // EN: Air quality panel · readings and alerts
    "Hareket sens\u00f6r\u00fc paneli \u00b7 alg\u0131lama ve uyar\u0131lar": "Judesio jutiklio skydelis \u00b7 aptikimas ir \u012fsp\u0117jimai", // EN: Motion sensor panel · detection and alerts
    "Kap\u0131 ve pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7\u0131k/kapal\u0131 durumu": "Dur\u0173 ir lang\u0173 jutikli\u0173 skydelis \u00b7 atidaryta/u\u017edaryta b\u016bkl\u0117", // EN: Door and window sensor panel · open/closed state
    "Evcil hayvan kontrol paneli \u00b7 besleme, takip": "Gyv\u016bn\u0173 valdymo skydelis \u00b7 maitinimas, steb\u0117jimas", // EN: Pet control panel · feeding, tracking
    "Bebek \u00fcr\u00fcnleri paneli \u00b7 izleme ve uyar\u0131lar": "K\u016bdikio produkt\u0173 skydelis \u00b7 steb\u0117jimas ir \u012fsp\u0117jimai", // EN: Baby products panel · monitoring and alerts
    "Sa\u011fl\u0131k ve uyku paneli \u00b7 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm, takip": "Sveikatos ir miego skydelis \u00b7 duomenys, sekimas", // EN: Health and sleep panel · readings, tracking
    "Spor ekipmanlar\u0131 paneli \u00b7 takip, \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm": "Sporto \u012frangos skydelis \u00b7 sekimas, duomenys", // EN: Sports equipment panel · tracking, readings
    "Bah\u00e7e ve sulama kontrol paneli \u00b7 vana, zamanlama": "Sodo ir laistymo valdymo skydelis \u00b7 vo\u017etuvas, planavimas", // EN: Garden and irrigation control panel · valve, scheduling
    "Medya kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, ses, kanal": "Medijos valdymo skydelis \u00b7 \u012fjungti, i\u0161jungti, garsas, kanalas", // EN: Media control panel · on, off, volume, channel
    "Ev aletleri kontrol paneli \u00b7 ba\u015flat, durdur, program": "Buitin\u0117s technikos valdymo skydelis \u00b7 prad\u0117ti, sustabdyti, programa", // EN: Home appliance control panel · start, stop, program
    "\u0130klim kontrol paneli \u00b7 s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem, mod": "Klimato valdymo skydelis \u00b7 temperat\u016bra, dr\u0117gm\u0117, re\u017eimas", // EN: Climate control panel · temperature, humidity, mode
    "Ortam sens\u00f6r\u00fc paneli \u00b7 s\u0131cakl\u0131k, \u0131\u015f\u0131k, durum": "Aplinkos jutikli\u0173 skydelis \u00b7 temperat\u016bra, \u0161viesa, b\u016bsena", // EN: Ambient sensor panel · temperature, light, status
    "Priz ve enerji kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat, t\u00fcketim": "Lizdo ir energijos valdymo skydelis \u00b7 \u012fjungti, i\u0161jungti, sunaudojimas", // EN: Plug and energy control panel · on, off, consumption
    "Ula\u015f\u0131m ve takip paneli \u00b7 konum, \u015farj": "Transporto ir sekimo skydelis \u00b7 vieta, \u012fkrovimas", // EN: Transport and tracking panel · location, charge
    "A\u011f ge\u00e7idi paneli \u00b7 ba\u011flant\u0131, durum": "Pagrindinio tinklo skydelis \u00b7 ry\u0161ys, b\u016bsena", // EN: Gateway panel · connection, status
    "Anahtar kontrol paneli \u00b7 a\u00e7, kapat": "Jungiklio valdymo skydelis \u00b7 \u012fjungti, i\u0161jungti", // EN: Switch control panel · on, off
    "Bu ad ana sayfa kart\u0131nda ve cihaz listesinde g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "\u0160is pavadinimas rodomas pagrindiniame korte ir \u012frengini\u0173 s\u0105ra\u0161e.", // EN: This name shows on the home card and in the device list.
    "Cihaz ad\u0131n\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftir": "Pervadinti \u012frengin\u012f", // EN: Rename device
    "\u015eifre Belirle": "Nustatyti slapta\u017eod\u012f", // EN: Set a password
    "Bu hesapta hen\u00fcz \u015fifre yok": "\u0160iam paskyrai dar n\u0117ra nustatyto slapta\u017eod\u017eio", // EN: This account has no password yet
    "\u015eifren belirlendi \u2713": "J\u016bs\u0173 slapta\u017eodis nustatytas \u2713", // EN: Your password is set ✓
    "Bu hesap Google ile a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, i\u00e7inde hen\u00fcz bir \u015fifre yok. \u0130lk \u015fifreni burada belirleyebilirsin; bundan sonra e-posta ve \u015fifreyle de giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "\u0160i paskyra buvo atidaryta naudojant Google ir dar neturi slapta\u017eod\u017eio. Nustatykite savo pirm\u0105j\u012f slapta\u017eod\u012f \u010dia; po to gal\u0117site prisijungti ir naudodami el. pa\u0161t\u0105 ir slapta\u017eod\u012f.", // EN: This account was opened with Google and has no password yet. Set your first password here; after that you can also sign in with email and password.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 e-postama g\u00f6nder": "Si\u0173sti man nuorod\u0105 slapta\u017eod\u017eio nustatymui", // EN: Email me a password setup link
    "Bu i\u015flem ek do\u011frulama istiyor. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan \u015fifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 isteyebilirsin.": "\u0160iam veiksmui reikia papildomo patvirtinimo. \u017demiau galite papra\u0161yti nuorodos slapta\u017eod\u017eio nustatymui.", // EN: This action needs extra verification. You can request a password setup link below.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 e-postana g\u00f6nderildi \u2713": "Nuoroda slapta\u017eod\u017eio nustatymui i\u0161si\u0173sta \u012f j\u016bs\u0173 pa\u0161to d\u0117\u017eut\u0119 \u2713", // EN: Password setup link sent to your inbox ✓
    "\u015eifre ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u015fu anda g\u00f6nderilemiyor.": "\u0160iuo metu nuorodos negalima si\u0173sti.", // EN: The password link can't be sent right now.
    "Giri\u015f e-postan bulunamad\u0131; \u00f6nce giri\u015f yap.": "Negal\u0117jome rasti j\u016bs\u0173 prisijungimo el. pa\u0161to; prisijunkite pirmiausia.", // EN: We couldn't find your sign-in email; sign in first.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi. Birazdan tekrar dene.": "Nuorodos siuntimas nepavyko. Pabandykite dar kart\u0105 po keli\u0173 akimirk\u0173.", // EN: The link couldn't be sent. Try again in a moment.
