    "Aile sohbeti i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7mal\u0131s\u0131n.": "Nor\u0117dami naudotis \u0161eimos pokalbiu, turite prisijungti.", // EN: You need to sign in for the family chat.
    "Cihaz eklenince haz\u0131r senaryolar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Paruo\u0161tos scenos \u010dia bus rodomos, kai prid\u0117site \u012frengin\u012f.", // EN: Ready-made scenes will appear here once you add a device.
