    " A command was sent over your local network to {0} devices.": "Komanda buvo i\u0161si\u0173sta per j\u016bs\u0173 vietin\u012f tinkl\u0105 \u012f {0} \u012frenginius.", // EN: A command was sent over your local network to {0} devices.
    " A command was sent over your local network to 1 device.": "Komanda buvo i\u0161si\u0173sta per j\u016bs\u0173 vietin\u012f tinkl\u0105 \u012f 1 \u012frengin\u012f.", // EN: A command was sent over your local network to 1 device.
    "\u26a0 The command did not reach {0} \u2014 make sure it is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi network.": "\u26a0 Komanda nepasiek\u0117 {0} \u2014 \u012fsitikinkite, kad jis \u012fjungtas ir prijungtas prie to paties Wi-Fi tinklo.", // EN: ⚠ The command did not reach {0} — make sure it is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi network.
