    "Nothing is on right now, the house is quiet.": "\u0160iuo metu niekas ne\u012fjungtas, namai tyl\u016bs.", // EN: Nothing is on right now, the house is quiet.
    "These need your attention: {0}.": "\u0160ie dalykai reikalauja j\u016bs\u0173 d\u0117mesio: {0}.", // EN: These need your attention: {0}.
