    "Which device should I turn on? Use a device name, a room or a type like \"lights\" or \"plugs\". Your paired devices: {0}.": "Kur\u012f \u012frengin\u012f tur\u0117\u010diau \u012fjungti? Naudokite \u012frenginio pavadinim\u0105, kambar\u012f arba tip\u0105, kaip \u201e\u0161viesos\u201c arba \u201eki\u0161tukai\u201c. J\u016bs\u0173 susieti \u012frenginiai: {0}.", // EN: Which device should I turn on? Use a device name, a room or a type like "lights" or "plugs". Your paired devices: {0}.
    "Which device should I turn off? Use a device name, a room or a type like \"lights\" or \"plugs\". Your paired devices: {0}.": "Kur\u012f \u012frengin\u012f tur\u0117\u010diau i\u0161jungti? Naudokite \u012frenginio pavadinim\u0105, kambar\u012f arba tip\u0105, kaip \u201e\u0161viesos\u201c arba \u201eki\u0161tukai\u201c. J\u016bs\u0173 susieti \u012frenginiai: {0}.", // EN: Which device should I turn off? Use a device name, a room or a type like "lights" or "plugs". Your paired devices: {0}.
