    "I set up the \"{0}\" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} devices. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).": "Suk\u016briau automatizacij\u0105 \u201e{0}\u201c: ji vykdoma {1} ir reguliuoja {2} \u012frenginius. Automatizacijos veikia, kol programa atidaryta (taip pat i\u0161 d\u0117klo kompiuteryje).", // EN: I set up the "{0}" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} devices. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).
