    "I added \"{0}\" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} devices.": "A\u0161 prid\u0117jau \u201e{0}\u201c prie Bakstel\u0117k, kad paleistum; vienas bakstel\u0117jimas reguliuoja {1} \u012frenginius.", // EN: I added "{0}" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} devices.
    "I added \"{0}\" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} device.": "A\u0161 prid\u0117jau \u201e{0}\u201c prie Bakstel\u0117k, kad paleistum; vienas bakstel\u0117jimas reguliuoja {1} \u012frengin\u012f.", // EN: I added "{0}" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} device.
    "That does not look like a device command. Try: \"turn off the living room light\" or \"set the AC to 22\".": "Tai neatrodo kaip \u012frenginio komanda. Pabandykite: \u201ei\u0161junkite svetain\u0117s \u0161vies\u0105\u201c arba \u201enustatykite oro kondicionieri\u0173 \u012f 22\u201c.", // EN: That does not look like a device command. Try: "turn off the living room light" or "set the AC to 22".
